Title: Multi-state hazard and multi-state hidden Markov models
Description: Models multi-state time to event data.
The icmsh function fits an interval censored multi-state hazard model, 
the hmm function extends this to hidden Markov models (HMM)
Package: mshmm
Version: 2.0-0
Depends: survival, expm
Imports:  parallel, mvtnorm, quadprog
Suggests: msm, knitr
Lazyload: Yes
LazyData: Yes
VignetteBuilder: knitr
